## Data Flow & Integration Notes

- Ingest data from multiple providers, normalize into canonical entities with a consistent payload shape
- Persist sourceReferences for reconciliation; maintain externalId per provider
- Keep a robust linking engine to associate disparate records across providers
- Ensure identity resolution and tenant scoping in all read paths
- Provide strongly typed APIs and clear error semantics for failed ingestions or link operations

