## UI/UX Guidelines

Apply the project's design system consistently across all components:
- Visual style: as provided in the Visual Style section
- Layout: 12-column grid, generous whitespace, left-aligned hero blocks
- Components: modular, reusable Card, KPI tiles, and list components
- Interactions: smooth transitions (120–200ms), accessible focus states
- Typography: Poppins/Manrope for headings; Inter/Roboto for UI
- Color usage: adhere to the palette; primary accents in #9AD0FF and #00D27A; surfaces in #0F1720/#0C1116; text in #F7FAFF and #8FA0B0

